     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Please share profile on <a href style=\"color:blue\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ja...@nestarit.com</a> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Direct contact number: <a href=\"tel:(201)%20448-1184\" value=\"+12014481184\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(201) 448 1184</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hello,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hope you’re doing great!!!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Please go through the below requirement and\r\nIf you have suitable candidate&#39;s kindly share updated resume along with below\r\nContact  details</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Job Title: UX Designer</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Location: San Jose, CA</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Duration: 06+ Months Contract</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><i><span style=\"color:red\"> </span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><i><span style=\"color:red\">Rate: $60/hr on All\r\nInc…</span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Job Description: </b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Key Accountabilities </b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">•Work closely with stakeholders\r\nand team members to execute on data and research, ensuring experiences are\r\nengineered using best practices, on brand, and achieve defined goals. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">•Support all experience\r\nengineering initiatives across all channels and touch-points, both digital and\r\nnon-digital. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">•Assist leading any project\r\nthrough our UX design lifecycle, working closely with stakeholders, team\r\nmembers, technology teams, and others to achieve tested, validated results,\r\noutputs, successfully meeting metrics goals. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">•Support and produce for all\r\ncustomer experience design needs, across all channels. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">•Attend industry event and\r\nsupport further learning and development through internal and online training </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Your Skills and Qualifications will include :</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b>Qualifications </b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">ability to construct functional\r\nprototypes leveraging HTML, CSS, JS, and various frameworks. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Strong qualitative and\r\nquantitative analytical abilities, with first-rate attention to detail and </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">presentation skills. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Understanding of working in <b>AGILE\r\ncross-functional</b> teams </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Experience of working closely\r\nwith UX Research, visual designers and developers </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Workshop: Discovery, inception\r\nsessions, requirements gathering and co-creation, and the </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">ability to lead groups of people\r\nthrough design led methodologies. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Understanding of accessibility\r\nand inclusive design. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Strong project portfolio that\r\nclearly demonstrates the caliber of UX engineering and design </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">skills </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">o Ability to demonstrate strong\r\ndesign thinking, lateral approach, and leadership of UX, as </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">well as UX design principles,\r\ncurrent, and emerging.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">-------------------------------</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;b